ong><em>000000;border-top-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0pt;width:58.5pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<p><span>to 1</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 6pt 0pt 6pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0pt;width:58.5pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<p><span>5.6</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 6pt 0pt 6pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0pt;width:58.5pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<p><span>to 1</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr></tbody></table>","plainText":"Initial Setback Distance (in feet) Maximum Height of a Front Wall or other portion of a Building or Other Structure within the Initial Setback Distance Sky Exposure Plane Height above the Street Line (in feet) Slope over Zoning Lot (Expressed as a Ratio of Vertical Distance to Horizontal Distance) On Narrow Street On Wide Street On Narrow Street On Wide Street Vertical Distance Horizontal Distance Vertical Distance Horizontal Distance Within C3 C4-1 C8-1 Districts 20 15 30 feet or two stories, whichever is less 30 1 to 1 1 to 1 Within C1-6 C2-6 C4-2 C4-3 C4-4 C4-5 C8-2 C8-3 Districts 20 15 60 feet or four stories, whichever is less 60 2.7 to 1 5.6 to 1 Within C1-7 C1-8 C1-9 C2-7 C2-8 C4-2F C4-6 C4-7 C4-8 C4-9 C4-11 C4-12 C5 C6 C8-4 Districts 20 15 85 feet or six stories, whichever is less 85 2.7 to 1 5.6 to 1"},{"id":"zr-17760-block-006","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>However, in accordance with the provisions of Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-2#32-42\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-2#32-42\"><span>32-42</span></a> (Location within Buildings), in C1, C2 or C3 Districts, no <strong><em>commercial building</em></strong>, or portion thereof, occupied by non-<strong><em>residential uses</em></strong> listed under Use Groups VI through X&nbsp;shall exceed in height 30 feet or two <strong><em>stories</em></strong>, whichever is less.</span></p>","plainText":"However, in accordance with the provisions of Section 32-42 (Location within Buildings), in C1, C2 or C3 Districts, no commercial building, or portion thereof, occupied by non-residential uses listed under Use Groups VI through X shall exceed in height 30 feet or two stories, whichever is less."},{"id":"zr-17760-block-007","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In C4-1 or C8-1 Districts, for <strong><em>community facility buildings</em></strong> or <strong><em>buildings</em></strong> used for both <strong><em>community facility</em></strong> and <strong><em>commercial</em></strong> <strong><em>use</em></strong>, the maximum height of a front wall shall be 35 feet or three <strong><em>stories</em></strong>, whichever is less, and the height above <strong><em>street line</em></strong> shall be 35 feet.</span></p>","plainText":"In C4-1 or C8-1 Districts, for community facility buildings or buildings used for both community facility and commercial use, the maximum height of a front wall shall be 35 feet or three stories, whichever is less, and the height above street line shall be 35 feet."},{"id":"zr-17760-block-008","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In C1-6, C2-6, C4-4 or C4-5 Districts, for <strong><em>community facility buildings</em></strong> or <strong><em>buildings</em></strong> used for both <strong><em>community facility</em></strong> and <strong><em>commercial</em></strong> <strong><em>use</em></strong>, the maximum height of a front wall shall be 60 feet or six <strong><em>stories</em></strong>, whichever is less.</span></p>","plainText":"In C1-6, C2-6, C4-4 or C4-5 Districts, for community facility buildings or buildings used for both community facility and commercial use, the maximum height of a front wall shall be 60 feet or six stories, whichever is less."},{"id":"zr-17760-block-009","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\">&nbsp;</p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-17760-block-010","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"center-align\"><span><a href=\"../../../assets/zr-ae85037697815e61-Zoning-Resolutions-33-432.0.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Zoning Resolutions 33-432.0\" src=\"../../../assets/zr-ae85037697815e61-Zoning-Resolutions-33-432.0.png\" title=\"\"></a></span></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-17760-block-011","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"center-align\"><span>SKY EXPOSURE PLANE IN OTHER COMMERCIAL DISTRICTS</span><br><span>(23 - 632, 24 - 522, 33 - 432, 43 - 43)</span></p>","plainText":"SKY EXPOSURE PLANE IN OTHER COMMERCIAL DISTRICTS(23 - 632, 24 - 522, 33 - 432, 43 - 43)"}],"zoning":{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceNodeID":17760,"sourcePath":"/article-iii/chapter-3/33-432","sourceURL":"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-3/33-432","sourceContentHash":"ecfcec3c4f18ab5ac163b87f5ba9ad0ff20ec239c8b09f03e0746e3e1e694f8f","article":{"roman":"III","title":"Commercial District Regulations"},"chapter":{"number":"3","title":"Bulk Regulations for Commercial or Community Facility Buildings in Commercial Districts","canonicalNumber":"III-3"},"appendix":null,"subsections":[{"id":"zr-17760-sub-f4da97b572ec3